<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 Timoteho</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a tsomi wa Pahuli huli Timoteho</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoteho</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a tsomi wa Pahuli huli</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Nduhi a Timoteho bubaasinzatata yo mu libuuku la Mavaanga ma Biluumbi, na mu mihanda mya Pahuli. Baakatata nduhi a nde mu tooni ati, Timoteho abedi tsyengi a Pahuli wu isalu. Nde akayakeele Pahuli mu midyenge mya nde mi milahi. Pahuli akatsindaha nde, hu misyenge mya Tesalonika na Koliito, na ubaatsindaha nde mu mambuha makima ma pasi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli atsindihi mihanda myole huli Timoteho. Nde asonihi myo, mu taangu yi nde hatsimi uhwadisa imiinu hya ba banyatihi mu libundu la Kristo. Bunuubu, ka taangu yi uvangimasa na usuungaha isalu hi libundu, mana imiinu hya bo hisinzaba na mifudi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda watsomi ni wu li mu uva mandoongi huli baa Mukristo, huli bakuutu ba libundu na huli Timoteho nde mwakulu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwana a kabu la baa Mukristo, lili mu ulongese mi myavelesungama (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-7">1.3-7</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 4:1-4">4.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:3-5">6.3-5</ref></char>). Bo bali mu utsima ti, bo baakangama mu ndongisili yimbi. Ni mu buuna, bo bubaabisa kwelili na ndiili a byudya bikima. Kaahu, byosi bi Nzambi havanga, bibibwe bili. Timoteho afwana uyibwala mo huli baa Mukristo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mabuli ma baa Mukristo maavangimi. Mo na bakuutu. Ni bakuutu ba mabuli, na bakeelisi babubaakumbasa bo, na uvangimasa isalu hi biyaha, na hi babeedu. Ka ba baafulala bukuutu, ni baa bubaabita mikungi na ulongese. Mabuli mo maniima, na nzala yi utsahala hutso bulembo, mana baatu boosi bakiinza bo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musonihi muhanda mo wunuuwu, li mu uva mandoongi mu bibitili bi mikungi na masambulu (buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 2">2</ref></char>). Nde li mu umweese kaka, buni mbiili bakuutu ba libundu yafwana uba (buli li <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 3">3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Taata a Timoteho Mungeleke ali, ngu a nde Muyudaayo wu akasa hiitu mu Kristo. Timoteho ayaki ndongisili a Pahuli yoosi, we mwaana a nde mwakulu. Humbisa, nde akituhi mutumi na mukuutu watsomi wu mabundu. Muhanda mo wunuuwu li mu utuma Timoteho, mu uba musalili a Yisu Kristo wu mubwe. Muhanda li mu umweese Timoteho, buni baafwana ukeelese kele mwaana libundu, na ki mambu nde hafwana ulongese na utuma muutu-muutu (buli li <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 4-6">4–6</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Me Pahuli, ndi iluumbi hya Kristo Yisu. Me ndi mu unzabisa we mu tumili a Nzambi Mufuhisi a bisu, na mu tumili a Kristo Yisu wu uli hiitu hya bisu. <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Me ndi mu utsonehele huli we Timoteho. We li mwaana a me mwakulu, mu hiitu hya we mu Kristo. Nyaha Nzambi Taata na Kristo Yisu Pfumu a bisu, bava we hyenze, bakwila we lingebe na uva we hyese.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kebisili mu ndongisili yi mapfuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Tsahala hu musyenge a Efeso, we bu me akwadisi we ŋa me akanzyene hu tsi a Masedonya. Huuna, huli na baatu bakima babali mu uva ndongisili yi mapfuta. Liha bo mu uva ndongisili mo yiina. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Leele bo banyaha masahu mo maana, na utanga mihanda mimila, mi manduhi ma bakaaha. Maana moosi ubaabehe ndulu ukaakana, hwavele uvanga litondo la Nzambi, li libaavangama mu imiinu.<verse eid="1TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Tsongo a nzibusili mo yiina, ni mu upalisa litondo. Litondo li libaamata hutso mutima wu atsyeme, na matsimi ma mabwe, na imiinu hi hyavele na muwala. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Bakima baamiitahuha na nzila mo yiina, na baamiiyadunga hutso bileedi bi byavele na kaluha. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Bo ubaasaha uba milongisi mi Mikele mya Nzambi. Ka bo a bali mu utsikaha mambu ma bo bali mu uleele ve, tso ma bo bali mu uyabisa na hiitu hyoosi.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Bisu liyaabi ti Mikele mya Nzambi mili mimibwe, tso baatu bali mu usalila myo we bu hwafwana. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Mu mbuli, bisu liyabi kaka ti, Nzambi a havanga Mikele mu baatu ba baakuha ve. Nde havanga kaka Mikele mu tooni a ba baavele na lisingala, bangoyi, banga bukanyi, banga masumu, ba baavelekiinza Nzambi, na bya ngidi. Nde havanga Mikele, mu tooni a baatu ba bubaaduba bataata na bangu ba bo, napa mu badubi ba baatu. <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />Nzambi havanga Mikele, mu tooni a baatu banga butsutsungu, baa bubaanyiha masambu babahala na babahala, babali mu usumbasa bambaahi mu buviha. Nzambi havanga kaka Mikele, mu tooni a banga mapfuta, banga milabu mi mapfuta, na mu moosi ma maasobono na ndongisili yimbwe yi benu laayaki. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Ndongisili mo yiniiyi, yayelemene na Musamu wu Mubwe wu baaviidi me, wu ubaamata huli Nzambi Nga Muyusu.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miifutala matondo huli Nzambi mu bubwe bwa nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Me ndi mu upfutala matondo huli Yisu Kristo Pfumu a bisu, wu aviidi me matwala, mu tooni ati nde amoni ti me ndi wu apfwana, mu ukuhasa isalu hya nde. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Nzambi akwili me lingebe, tso bu me akandeele ma mabi mu nde, tso bu me akakwamisa baatu ba nde, tso bu me amba mutuhi. Nde hasiidi buuna, mu tooni ati, me a hakanzaba ma me akapanga ve, mu pelili imiinu. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Pfumu a bisu amiipuhala hyese hya nde mu me, mu iteesi hi hyafulala. Nde akumbisi me mu usa imiinu mu nde, na mu utondo bana. Maana moosi mu ubaayelemene, mu tooni a bu me akangama mu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Liniili ni dyaambu la mbuli, li baatu boosi baafwana uyaka: Yisu Kristo amiiya ŋa tsi mu uyobolo banga masumu. Ka me watsomi ŋa hati la bo. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Ka Nzambi amiikwila me lingebe, wu uli watsomi mu banga masumu. Nde havangi buuna, mana nde amweese huli baatu mukami a nde. Nde avoli me we ifwaani, mana bakima baa bu usa imiinu mu nde, bayaka moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Butsitu na muyusu biba, huli Pfumu mataangu moosi! Nde wu uli Nzambi ndulu mosi, wu avelekwa, na wu bubaavelemono! Ameni!<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulwana mudiingu wu afwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Timoteho mwaana a me, me ndeele we buni we afwana mu usa, we bu hwayelemene na mbihulili yi baasiidi mu we umata beleve. Nyaha mambu mo maana mava we ibahala, mana we yaba buni we ulwana mudingu wu afwana. <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />Keelese imiinu hya we na matsimi ma mabwe. Bakima baamiitimba matsimi ma bo, na imiinu hya bo hyamiiyene mu nyamba. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Imene na Alekizandi bali mu litangu la baatu mo baana. Me apahulili bo huli Saatana, mana batungalala bo mu uveletuha Nzambi.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lisambulu mu tooni a baatu boosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Hati a tsomi, dyaambu li me pondi huli we Timoteho ni linili: vondo huli Nzambi, mu masambulu ma we, mu ulembesene nde, na mu ufutala matondo huli Nzambi mu baatu boosi. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Sambila mu tooni bapfumu, na mu tooni a boosi ba bali na lituma. Sambila mu bo, mana bisu a benu liba na idiingu hya hyenze hyoosi hutso a mbiili yi yafwana. Ni mu mbiili a bisu a benu, luumweese ti bisu a benu baatu ba likiinzu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Liina ni dyaambu lilibwe, li Nzambi Muyobili a bisu hasilasa. <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />Nzambi wu tondi ti baatu boosi bayoboho na baya hu nzaabili a imbuli.<verse eid="1TI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Mu mbuli, Nzambi ndulu mosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 2:5">muvolili mileembe ndulu mumosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 2:5">ŋa hati la Nzambi na baatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 2:5">Ni Yisu Kristo, muutu<verse eid="1TI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />wu ayehuli muvumu a nde we kodi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 2:6">mu uyobolo baatu boosi mu masumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><char style="xt">Mat 20.28</char></char></note>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 2:6">Mu taangu yi yafwana, Nzambi amweesi Kristo we mbangi a libwe la nde. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Ni mu buuna, Nzambi hasoolo me, mu uba mulongisi na iluumbi huli ba bavele Bayudaayo. Nzambi hasoolo me, mu ulongese bo musamu wu imiinu hya mbuli. Me a ndi mu upfuta ve, ka ndulu imbuli me ndi mu undeele.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbiili yi yafwana huli babahala na bakaasu mu libundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Ni mu buuna, me tondi ti babahala babaasambila kindi mbuha, na ubaasyenolo myoho mi myatsyeme, hwavele a kesi na bileedi.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Me tondi kaka ti, bakaasu babaalwata bu hwafwana. A mu tooni umonehele ve, ka mu butsitu bwosi. Bakaasu a bafwana uyolo linyutu la bo mu mivanda, mu wolo, mu bilunga na milwatu mya talu ve. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Ka bo baafwana umweese yoli-yoli a bo, mu mavaanga ma mabwe. Yiina ni mbiili yi yafwana mu bakaasu ba bubaayusa Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Bakaasu baafwana uba «swii» mu taangu a ndongisili, na ubaayuha hutso a kulimini. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Me a handi mu upa muswa huli mukaasu mu ulongese ve, buuve mu uba na lituma ŋa yulu a babahala ve. Nde afwana ubaayuha. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Me ndeeli buuna, mu tooni ati, tswamina Nzambi mu uvanga mukaasu Eva, nde amavaanga bahala Adami. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Wu baasohi a Adami ve, ka mukaasu. Bu mukaasu hasiingi soho, nde abisi tumili a Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Ka mukaasu hu uyoboho, ŋa nde hu ubuta baana, tso nde kwilili mu imiinu, mu litondo na mu piili linyutu, na mu umweese mbiili yi yibaava muyusu huli Nzambi.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Musamu a bungeele ni wunuwu:</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1TI 3:1">Mbiili yi yafwana mu batumi baa libundu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 3:1">«Muutu atondo uba mutumi libundu, nde miisoolo isalu hi ibwe.» <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Mutumi libundu afwana uba wu avele masyembo, mulumi a mukaasu mumosi, nga mbiili yi yasungama, nga tsiki, nga butsitu na wu akuha. Nde afwana uba muyaki a byenyi na wu utwala ulongese libundu. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />Mutumi libundu utwala uba ikolo-mbungu ve. Nde utwala uba nga ngaabi ve, ka nde afwana uba nga bulembo. Nde utwala uba nga a bisongi ve, tso wu avelekebele mbongo mu diisu. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Mutumi libundu, afwana utuma nzo a nde mwakulu bubwe-bubwe. Baana ba nde bafwana usiingala nde na likiinzu loosi. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Tso muutu a hatwali utuma nzo a nde mwakulu ve, buni nde hutwala utuma libundu la Nzambi? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Nde utwala uba wu munyatihi mu libundu ve, kini nde unangimana bana mu nyeme. Mana Nzambi a hasyembe nde we bu hasyembi Saatana. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Hwafwana kaka ti, baatu babali hu mbadi libundu, batiila nde imbangi hi ibwe. Imbangi mo hiina, mana bavelerokolo nde, na nde avelebwa mu myeto mi Mukuyi.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbiili bakeelisi balibundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Bakeelisi ba libundu kaka, ni bumosi, baafwana uba baatu banga likiinzu, na banga imbuli. Bo utwala ukoto mutso a nywili malamu yinono ve, na mu mbahili a mbongo ya tsonyi ve. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Bo baafwana ukeelese mambu ma Nzambi hayabisi, mu matsimi ma matsyeme. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Baafwana umaakete mbiili a bo. Titswene, tso a bamoni lilibi mu bo ve, bo utwala usa isalu hya bo hi bukeelisi bu libundu. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Bakadi ba bakeelisi balibundu kaka ni bumosi, baafwana uba na likiinzu, babaavele na makusa, babaakuta linyutu. Ka baba ba baasungama mu mambu moosi. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Mukeelisi libundu, afwana uba ndulu mulumi a mukaasu mumosi. Bakeelisi baafwana utuma baana ba bo na manzo ma bo mwakulu bubwe-bubwe. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Bakeelisi balibundu boosi ba bu usa isalu hya bo bubwe, bu uyaka muyusu. Ni mu buuna, bo utwala uyabisa na hiitu hyoosi, imiinu hi ibaapfuuta bisu mu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzabiili yi imiinu hibaava bisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Me ndi mu utsonehele we muhanda mo wunuuwu, mu hiitu hi uyamonehele na we, mutso bilumbu mo biniibi. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Ka tso nziili a me yitambi, yaba buni we afwana udyata mu nzo a Nzambi. Ni libundu la Nzambi a moonyi, wu likuunzi lilinene, na ibene hi imbuli. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Mu mbuli, muutu utwala utuna love ti, tswehi matsimi ma inzambi, yi Nzambi hayabisi bisu, yili yinene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kristo ayamonehele huli bisu mu linyutu li musunya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Livupu la Ngidi laasilisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">ti nde li wu akuha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Nde amonihili huli bapofi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">na baayabisi tsangu a nde, huli ba bavele Bayudaayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Baayaki nde na hiitu mu tsi yoosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Nzambi asyenuli nde mu muyusu.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Byosi bi Nzambi havanga bili bibibwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Livupu la Ngidi lili mu uyabisa paayalala ti, mu tsukusu a taangu, mwaana a kabu la baatu bu unyahula imiinu mu Kristo. Bo bu ukangama na mavupu ma mapfuta, na uyuha ndongisili matengo. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Banga mapfuta mo baana, bali mu ulongese ndongisili yi muwala. Matsimi ma bo, maka we ma baamiitsuha mu itali hi hyabenge mu mbaahu. Ni mu buuna, bo bu ubweveletsikaha ma mabwe na ma mabi. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Baatu mo baana bali mu uliha baatu ukwelesene, na usa mangidi mu byudya bikima. Ka Nzambi ni wu avanga byudya mo biina, mana banga imiinu babaayaba imbuli, babaadya byo na pfutili matondo. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Byosi bi Nzambi havanga bili bibibwe. A huli na tso imosi hi ubisa ve. Pungu ati, tso bisu lidiidi, libaadya byo na pfutili matondo huli Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Mu byudya mo biina, ni mambu ma Nzambi na lisambulu, byamiikitusa byo bya ngidi.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uba musalili wu mubwe wa Yisu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Tso we viidi mandoongi mo maana huli baana ba ngu, we uba musalili wu mubwe wa Yisu Kristo. We umweese ti, baamiibuungala we mu mambu ma imiinu, na mu ndongisili yimbwe yi we ayaki na bukuhu. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Ka, bisa makuma ma maavele na tsongo, na masahu ma butsudu. Hwada mu ukangama na Nzambi.<verse eid="1TI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Bingana bya nyutu na tsongo mu mambu ma hole. Ka ukangama mu Nzambi, huli na tsongo mu moosi. Mu tooni ati, huli wu akangama mu Nzambi, baamiivangila nde idiingu hya loloyi, na baamiilaha nde moonyi wu bilumbu bya hu mbisa lipfu.<verse eid="1TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Monwaani musamu a mbuli wu baatu boosi baafwana usiinga hwavele a paha:<verse eid="1TI 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Bisu libaasala na libaahumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 4:10">bu bisu lasuusa hiitu hya bisu mu Nzambi a moonyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 4:10">wuli Muyobili a baatu boosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 4:10">fula-fula ba baakangama mu nde.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Mono, ni liina we afwana utuma na ulongese. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Muutu tso mumosi a hapenye bufudu bwa we ve. Ka hwada mu uba ifwaani huli banga imiinu mu mikuma mya we, mu mbiili a we, mu litondo, mu imiinu na mu tsyemili mutima a we. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Tswamina me nza, hwada mu utangila libundu mambu ma Nzambi, mu uhwadisa lo na mu ulongese lo. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />A habungasana hyese hi Livupu la Ngidi hi we ayaki. Hyese hi baaviidi we mu mbihulili, mu taangu yi bakuutu ba libundu baasuusili we myoho. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Salila maana moosi mu mutima a we, va linyutu la we mu mo, mana baatu boosi bamono ti we li mu usinzakula. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Keelese bubwe-bubwe nyutu a we mwakulu, na ndongisili a we, mana we kwilala mu maana moosi. We uvanga buuna, Nzambi uyobolo we na boosi ba bubaayuhala we.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Libundu ibaandu hiinene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />A hasyembe mukuutu libundu na bukanyi, ka longese nde mu bulembo we taata a we. Longese kaka pfudu-mbahala we baana ba ngu a we. <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Longese bakaasu ba baakula we bangu ba we, na banuumba we bibusi bya we, mu mutima wu atsyeme.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakwili mutso libundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Baakiinza bakwili ba bakaasu ba baavele na bakumbisi. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Tso mukwili li na baana buuve batehudu, bo baafwana umaamweese ukangama hwa bo mu Nzambi, mutso manzo ma bo, titswene ufutala ma mabwe ma bo baayaki huli bataata na bangu ba bo. Maana ni ma kinya huli Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Mukwili wu amiisaala siha vii, asusa hiitu hya nde mu Nzambi. Nde li mu ukwilala mu mapondili na masambulu huli Nzambi butsuhu na nyangu. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Ka mukwili wu ubaadyata mutso makinya ma tsi, nde amiikwa, tso bu nde ali moonyi. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Mono matumili ma we afwana uva bakwili, mu uyibusa bo, mana bavelesyembe bo. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Tso muutu a hali mu ukumbasa baa ibaandu hya nde mwakulu ve, fula-fula baa mu nzo a nde, nde amiituna imiinu. Buuna, nde afulala bubi na wu avelesa imiinu mu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Mu muhanda litangu, bakwili ba bakaasu ba libundu huva likumbasa, ndulu ba baamiivyoso tungi li maku masamunu (60) ma bilima. Nde afwana uba mukwili wu akoto kwele ndulu koto limosi. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Baafwana utiila nde imbangi mu mavaanga ma mabwe, bu nde habuhisi baana ba nde, bu hakayaka baatu bubwe. Bafwana utiila nde imbangi kaka, bu hakaswaha miilu mya baatu bangidi, bu hakakumbasa banga pumbu, na bu haba hakangama mu mavaanga moosi ma mabwe. <verse eid="1TI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Ka uto ti bakwili ba bakini banuumba, a hasonehe bo mu muhanda litangu. Mu tooni ati, ŋa bo bu uba na nzala yi ubwekwele, bo bu utahuha na Kristo. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Bo bavanga buuna, Nzambi utsundasa bo, bu baavelikeelese nzuhisini la nde latsomi, li bo baasiidi ŋa busu bwa nde. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Titswene, bu bo baavele na isalu hi usa, bo bubaataangila manzo ma baatu, mu ubaasaha uyiha. Ka ŋa yulu a maana, ndulu avele li isalu ve, bo bubaasa kaka lipedi li laavele a tswehi. Bo bubaakoto mu misamu mi myaveletala bo, na ubaatoyo ma bakiiveletoyo. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Ni mu buuna, me tondi ti bakwili ba bakini banuumba, babwekwele. Hwafwana ti bo babuta baana na ubaatuma manzo ma bo, mu uveleva nzila huli baa bubaatelemene bo, mu ukusa bo. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Ka bakwili ba banuumba bakima, baamiisobo nzila mu udukala Saatana. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Me mbwendeele, tso mukaasu nga imiinu li na bakwili mu buli la nde, nde afwana ukumbasa bo. Nde a hafwana ususa bo ŋa myoho mi libundu ve, mu tooni ati libundu laafwana ukumbasa ndulu bakwili ba siha vii.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakuutu mu libundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Bakuutu ba libundu baa bubaatuma libundu bubwe, baahwama na pfuta yole. Hwavele uvusana ba bali na isalu hiinene hi utanga mambu ma Nzambi, na ulongese bambaahi. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: «A laakutala munywa a ngombe wu li mu usala, mu taangu yi nde ubaadyata muhunu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">A laakutala munywa a ngombe wu li mu usala, mu taangu yi nde ubaadyata muhunu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Huli Bayudaayo, mu ubula muhunu a bo, bo baaba na ipfu hi usalila bangombe mu ubaadyata muhunu wu kini mu bipfumba. Mukele a Moose ubaaliha bo ti, ngombe adya muhunu wu uli mu toto, mu taangu yi nde ali mu usala.</char></note>.» Na: «Musali afwana uyaka pfuta a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Pfu 25.4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="1TI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />A hayaka mukesu mu mukuutu libundu, tso a husolihi bambangi boole buuve batatu ve. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Syembe baa bubaasa masumu ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi, mana bakuutu bakima kaka, bamono boomo. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, ŋa busu bwa Yisu Kristo na ŋa busu bu bapofi ba Nzambi hasoolo, me ndabi ŋa busu bwa we mu usalila mambu mo maana, hwavele buraandu, tso uvelevolele bakima mileembe. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />A habingalala usuusala muutu myoho, mu uva nde mupfuna mu libundu. Na a hasilasa masumu ma muutu mukima. We afwana uba we mwakulu wu atsyeme.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Kolo ubaanywa ndulu mamba, ka baasalila mwaana vinye hole mu tooni ifundu hya we, na mu tooni mabedu ma we. <verse eid="1TI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Masumu ma baatu bamosi, a mu ubaaswemene ve. Mo mu ubaatehele bo tswamina batsundasa bo. Ka huli bakima, masumu ma bo ubaayabana ka hu busu. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Ni bumosi kaka, mavaanga ma mabwe mu ubaamonehele mawasa, na ma mavelebingalala umonehele, utwala uswemene nzyeni ve.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Baviha na bapfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Nyaha boosi ba bali mu panga buviha, babaakiinza bapfumu ba bo we ba baakuha, mu uyaka muyusu woosi. Vaangaani buuna, mana pasi muutu a harokolo nduhi a Nzambi na ndongisili a nde. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Na, baviha ba bali na bapfumu banga imiinu, a baafwana upenye bo ve, bu bo bali baana ba ngu. Ka bo baafwana ubaasalila bo hu unzuhisini, bu bo bali banga imiinu na bambaahi ba litondo, ba bubaayaka likumbasa la bo lilibwe.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1TI 6:2">Imiinu hya mu Nzambi ni busina bwa mbuli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Maana ni ma we afwana ubaalongese na ubaatuma baatu. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Tso muutu li mu ulongese mandoongi makima, ma maasobono na mambu ma mbuli ma Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, buuve ma maasobono na ndongisili yi yibaayusa Nzambi, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />nde wuuna aluula mu isaayi. Muutu wa pila yiina, a hayabi isiha tso imosi ve. Nde na bubedu bwa paha mu tooni mikuma. Maana ni ubaabuta nyengi, ukakana, bituhi, na utsima mambu ma mabi mu bana. <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />Mo mu baabehe kaka ukakana hu hwavelefwa, ŋa hati la baatu banga buyedi bu bwatengeme. Bo a baabweyaba imbuli ve. Bo bubaatsima ti imiinu mu Nzambi, ni nzila yi ubahila busina.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Mu mbuli, imiinu mu Nzambi ni nzila yinene yi busina, tso muutu li mu umono kinya mu bi Nzambi hava nde. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Mu tooni ati, bisu a laabehi isiha tso imosi ŋa laayidi ŋa tsi ve. Ni bumosi kaka, a luutwala ubita isiha tso imosi ve, ŋa luusisa tsi mo yiniiyi. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Ni mu buuna, tso bisu lili na byudya, na bikutu, biina byukuha huli bisu. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Ka baa bubaasaha uba bisina, baamiibwa mu lobese na mu mweto manzala ma mabi ma maavele na tsongo. Manzala mo maana mu baabiyasa baatu na ubita bo hu lipfu. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Ka nzuki a mbongo, ni nzila a bisiha byosi bibibi. Mwana a kabu la baatu mu nzuki a mbongo, baatahuhi na imiinu hya bo, na baakwamisi linyutu la bo mwakulu.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulwana mudingu wu afwana wu imiinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Ka we muutu a Nzambi, bata maana moosi. Saha mbiili butsiitsa, muyusu a Nzambi, imiinu, litondo, mukami, na isusi. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Lwana mudingu wu afwana wu imiinu. Kanga moonyi wu bilima na bilima wu Nzambi haateeli we mu nde. Moonyi mo wuuna, ni wu we asiingi ŋa we abinuhi mu udukala nzila imiinu, ŋa busu bu bambangi ba banzuhisini. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Me ndi mu utuma we lo ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, wu ubaava moonyi huli bisiha byosi. Ŋa busu bwa Yisu Kristo, wu atiidi imbangi hi ibwe ŋa busu bwa Ponse Pilaato, me utuma we mu <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />ubaakeele mukele wu we ayaki na uba wu atsyeme na wu avele na masyembo, nate bu Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo hu uyamonehele.<verse eid="1TI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Yisu Kristo uyafutaha, mu taangu yi Nzambi hakese.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:15">Nde ni Nga Matwala moosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:15">Nga Kinya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:15">Mutumi batumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:15">Pfumu bapfumu,<verse eid="1TI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />ndulu ni nde wu uvelekwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:16">Nde ubaatsahala hutso liyalala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:16">li pasi muutu huvelekunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:16">mu ubeleme na lo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:16">Muutu tso mumosi kini a hamoni nde ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:16">tso utwala umono nde ve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:16">Nyaha muyusu na matwala biba huli nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 6:16">mu bilima na bilima! Ameni!<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandoongi huli bisina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Leele huli banga busina baa tsi mo yiniiyi, baveleba na isaayi. Leele bo bavelesa hiitu hya bo mu busina bu bubaadimbala, mu tooni ati, bwo a buudinga ve. Ka nyaha babaasa hiitu hya bo mu Nzambi, wu ubaava bisu byosi bi byafulala, mana bisu liba mu kinya. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Tuma bo babaavaanga ma mabwe, bo baba bisina mu mavaanga ma mabwe, mu umonehele banga a lehemene li ukabila bana. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Buuna, bo buukukaha busina bu bubwe na bu bwavangama bwa hu busu, na ukaanga moonyi wa mbuli.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Ho! Timoteho! Keelese isalu hi Nzambi hava we. Peke bileedi bi butsudu, na mikuma mi myasobono na imiinu. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Bamosi baasiingi ndongisili yi mapfuta yiina, we yi yaaba ya mbuli. Na bo baadungi nzila imiinu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Nyaha hyese hya Nzambi hiba na benu!<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>